<title>USA: Fed says coupon pass totaled $1.125 bln.</title>
<headline>Fed says coupon pass totaled $1.125 bln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve's purchase of coupons on Friday totaled $1.125 billion, a New York Fed spokeswoman confirmed.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk 212-859-1867 ))</p>
